   "en": "Despite his large build, Rinto has a gentle personality.\nHe spends his days practicing sumo with his childhood friend Konatsu and others.\nHowever, one day, Konatsu tells him something that changes everything.\nThis is a bittersweet coming-of-age story of a young sumo wrestler.\n\n(Source: MangaPlus)",
